#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.homepage
msgid ""
"85% of our clients have trusted us for their beverage distribution needs for "
"over five years."
msgstr ""
"85% ຂອງລູກຄ້າໄດ້ໄວ້ວາງໃຈພວກເຮົາ ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານການແຈກຢາຍເຄື່ອງດື່ມມາເປັນເວລາດົນກວ່າ 5 "
"ປີ."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Barcode App</b>: Accelerate picking and packing processes with mobile "
"scanners, ensuring accurate\n"
"                            inventory counts and faster loading."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແອັບບາໂຄດ (Barcode)</b>: ເລັ່ງຂະບວນການຈັດ ແລະ ຫໍ່ສິນຄ້າດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງສະແກນມືຖື, ຮັບປະກັນ\n"
"                            ການກວດນັບສະຕັອກທີ່ຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ໂຫຼດສິນຄ້າໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Inventory App</b>: Serve as the central hub for stock, managing "
"consignments, batch tracking, and\n"
"                            warehouse operations with precision."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ (Inventory)</b>: ເປັນສູນກາງຫຼັກໃນການຄຸ້ມຄອງສະຕັອກ, ຈັດການສິນຄ້າມັດຈຳ, ຕິດຕາ"
"ມເລກຊຸດ (Batch) ແລະ\n"
"                            ດຳເນີນງານໃນສາງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຊັດເຈນ."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manufacturing App</b>: Manage the repackaging of bulk items into smaller "
"saleable units automatically."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແອັບການຜະລິດ (Manufacturing)</b>: ຈັດການການແຍກຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ສິນຄ້າຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ໃຫ້ເປັນຫົວໜ່ວຍຍ່ອຍສຳ"
"ລັບຂາຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Point of Sale App</b>: process B2C sales efficiently at your distribution "
"center's front counter or\n"
"                            cash-and-carry section."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແອັບຈຸດຂາຍ (Point of Sale)</b>: ດຳເນີນການຂາຍແບບ B2C ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ ຢູ່ໜ້າເຄົາເຕີຂອງສູ"
"ນແຈກຢາຍ ຫຼື\n"
"                            ພະແນກ Cash-and-Carry."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Purchase App</b>: Automate replenishment from suppliers, ensuring you "
"have the right mix of beverages to\n"
"                            meet seasonal demand."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແອັບການຈັດຊື້ (Purchase)</b>: ສັ່ງຊື້ສິນຄ້າເຕີມສະຕັອກຈາກຜູ້ສະໜອງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີເຄື່"
"ອງດື່ມຫຼາກຫຼາຍຊະນິດພຽງພໍ\n"
"                            ເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການຕາມລະດູການ."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Sales App</b>: Handle high-volume client orders and manage complex "
"product catalogs with varying units of\n"
"                            measure (e.g., crate vs. bottle)."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແອັບການຂາຍ (Sales)</b>: ຈັດການຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຂອງລູກຄ້າ ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄອງລາຍການສິນຄ້າທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອ"
"ນ ດ້ວຍຫົວໜ່ວຍ\n"
"                            ວັດແທກທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແກັດ ທຽບກັບ ຕຸກ)."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>eCommerce App</b>: Expand your reach with a B2B portal that allows "
"restaurants and retailers to place\n"
"                            restocking orders online 24/7."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແອັບອີຄອມເມີຊ (eCommerce)</b>: ຂະຫຍາຍການເຂົ້າເຖິງດ້ວຍລະບົບ B2B ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮ້ານອາຫານ ແລະ "
"ຮ້ານຂາຍຍ່ອຍ\n"
"                            ສາມາດສັ່ງຊື້ສິນຄ້າເຕີມສະຕັອກທາງອອນລາຍໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ."

