#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On a regular basis, excises need to be declared. To support you with this "
"duty, a dashboard provides the necessary data by excise category entering "
"and exiting your fiscal deposit warehouse."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຕ້ອງມີການແຈ້ງອາກອນຊົມໃຊ້ເປັນປະຈຳ. ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍທ່ານໃນໜ້າທີ່ນີ້, ແຜງຄວບຄຸມ "
"(Dashboard) ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕາມໝວດໝູ່ອາກອນຊົມໃຊ້ ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ເຂົ້າ ແລະ ອອກຈາກສາງພັກອາກອ"
"ນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Dashboard app</strong> and reach the Excise dashboard in "
"the Finance menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບແຜງຄວບຄຸມ (Dashboard)</strong> ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ ແຜງຄວບຄຸມອາກອນຊົມໃຊ້ ໃນເມ"
"ນູ ການເງິນ (Finance)."

#. module: beverage_distributor
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beverage_distributor.homepage
msgid ""
"Our beverage specialists bring a wealth of knowledge and experience to "
"deliver top-quality solutions every time."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານດ້ານເຄື່ອງດື່ມຂອງພວກເຮົານຳເອົາຄວາມຮູ້ ແລະ ປະສົບການອັນຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ມາສົ່ງມອບວິທີແກ້ໄຂທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາ"
"ບສູງສຸດໃນທຸກໆຄັ້ງ."

